==Trivia==
*Gummy Cat has the most knockbacks of any [[Cat Units|Cat Unit]].
*Gummy Cat was the first unit to require real money to obtain.
**Because of this, purchasing units with real money was originally a feature exclusive to the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]].
*Unlike the Cat Unit, Gummy Cat's [[Gummy Cat (Enemy)|enemy counterpart]] can be found outside of the Japanese version, in [[Infernal Tower]] and [[Heartbeat Catcademy]] stages.
*Gummy Cat Soda had the highest chance to dodge [[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoths]]' attacks amongst all [[:Category:Behemoth Slayer Cats|Behemoth Slayer units]], before being surpassed by Cat Egg Pod's 50% in Version 12.7.

